From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenCode <opencode@localhost>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 10:40:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] sprd: put drivers/devfreq/sprd on its own include path so
 sprd_dfs_trace.h resolves

With the RORS31.335-58-1 headers and .c delta applied the tree builds up
to drivers/devfreq and then fails in the vendor DDR-DFS tracepoint:

  In file included from drivers/devfreq/sprd/sprd_dfs_auto_drv.c:32:
  In file included from drivers/devfreq/sprd/sprd_dfs_trace.h:78:
  ./include/trace/define_trace.h:89:10: fatal error:
      './sprd_dfs_trace.h' file not found
  #include TRACE_INCLUDE(TRACE_INCLUDE_FILE)

Reason: sprd_dfs_trace.h sets

  #define TRACE_INCLUDE_PATH .
  #define TRACE_INCLUDE_FILE sprd_dfs_trace

so include/trace/define_trace.h expands the include to the relative path
"./sprd_dfs_trace.h", which is resolved against the compilation directory
(the top of the tree), not against the source file's directory.  kbuild
only works for such a header when the directory is on the include path.

This is the standard kernel pattern; arch/arm64/kvm solves the identical
problem with "ccflags-y += -Iarch/arm64/kvm" for arch/arm64/kvm/trace.h,
and drivers/gpu/drm/sprd uses "subdir-ccflags-y += -I$(src)".

No public branch fixes this (checked R-11-release-RORS, RONS, RON,
android-11-release-rtas31.68-66-3, android-14-release-ula34,
andriod-15-release-vuoa35 - all carry the same 4-line Makefile), and the
shipped kernel does not contain the driver's symbols, so there is no
shipping binary to diff against.  The change is build-only: it adds an
include directory, it does not alter the objects that are produced.

 drivers/devfreq/sprd/Makefile | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/devfreq/sprd/Makefile b/drivers/devfreq/sprd/Makefile
index bdb1391fa941..a684bfdddeb5 100644
--- a/drivers/devfreq/sprd/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/devfreq/sprd/Makefile
@@ -2,3 +2,9 @@ obj-$(CONFIG_DEVFREQ_SPRD_AUTO_DFS)     += sprd_dfs_auto_drv.o
 obj-$(CONFIG_DEVFREQ_GOV_SPRD_SCENE)     += sprd_scene_governor.o
 obj-$(CONFIG_DEVFREQ_SPRD_EXT_VOTE_UMS512)     += sprd_dfs_vote_ums512.o
 obj-$(CONFIG_DEVFREQ_SPRD_EXT_VOTE_ROC1)     += sprd_dfs_vote_roc1.o
+
+# sprd_dfs_trace.h uses TRACE_INCLUDE_PATH "."; the trace machinery
+# includes "./sprd_dfs_trace.h" from include/trace/define_trace.h, so the
+# source directory must be on the include path (same pattern as
+# drivers/gpu/drm/sprd).
+ccflags-y += -I$(src)
-- 
